 * ============================================================================
 * Stacks both failure modes under a genuine hardware ceiling (no simulated
 * budget): FOUR large documents (~2.5K tokens each, ~10K total >> 8192 window),
 * each BURYING one unit price needed for the final answer. Single-turn; the
 * middleware assembles the context; one variable = the reducer.
 *
 *   raw           — concat all docs (~10K tok) > 8192 window → the REQUEST ERRORS
 *                   (the hard wall: you cannot even send it). Demonstrates the constraint.
 *   summarize     — gist per doc: fits, but every buried price is DROPPED → model can't answer
 *   chunk_retrieve — the price span per doc, verbatim: fits AND keeps all 4 prices → model answers
 *
